# Weekly data
table lat cols=week,p50,p95,p99

# What changed
Latency spiked in W35 after the search index migrated to the new cluster. It recovered once query caching shipped in W37, and every percentile has kept falling since; W41 is the best week in the period.

!! W35 is the only week that breached the SLO, with p99 at 688 ms.
